text = "1. Magic attacks cost 5 Light.
    Keep your light above 20 to see 
    clearly—if it hits 0, the dark 
    consumes you (Game Over).
2. Defeat Turtles to heal (+10 HP). 
    Defeat Dragonflies to recover 
    Light (+10 Light) and HP (+5 HP).
3. Watch for screen shakes before 
    Falling Spikes drop (-30 HP). 
    Falling into the Dark Void resets you
    to the start of the jump section.
4. Text choices will appear throughout 
     your run. +ve Hope guides
     you to safety, while -ve Hope
     lies to triggers game failure.

MENU CONTROLS:
WASD/ arrow keys - pointer control
Space/Enter - Select

GAME CONTROL:
A/ left arrow -  go left
S/ right arrow - go right
Space - Jump
"

